      "type": "brief",
      "date": "2025-12-22T07:39:12.000Z",
      "title": "MD & Executive Director recently bought ₹267k worth of stock",
      "body": "On the 17th of December, Atul Mittal bought around 200 shares on-market at roughly ₹1,335 per share. This transaction amounted to less than 1% of their direct individual holding at the time of the trade. In the last 3 months, they made an even bigger purchase worth ₹21m. Atul has been a buyer over the last 12 months, purchasing a net total of ₹105m worth in shares.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
